MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6657bd507c167b04d891725e055deac7, type: 3}
  m_Name: GrandFather
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GrandFather
  name: GrandFather
  IdleReplices:
  - Son, think carefully. Look around. Is what you're doing really worth it? If it
    is... then so be it.
  - Hahaha... Remember when you were little? You brought some strange beetle home
    and tried to keep it as a pet.
  - I always wondered what kind of man you'd become. Never thought I'd get my answer
    like this.
  - Life teaches many lessons, son. Sadly, some lessons arrive too late.
  - 'Your grandmother always said you were stubborn. Looks like she was right. '
  HoverReplices:
  - Doubt is normal. A choice made without doubt is usually a rushed one.
  - Change your mind as many times as you want. Just don't change it for people who
    don't care about you.
  - Take your time. Even a wrong choice should at least be your own.
  DragReplices:
  - Have you thought this through? If so, the choice is yours. Take care of yourself.
  - So you've decided... I respect that. Just don't let the Shaitan fool you.
  - If you're going to do it, do it with open eyes. Regret is heavier than any burden.
  PutInReplices:
  - Well... I always knew you were the defective branch of this family. Hopefully
    fate treats you the same someday.
  bonusDescription: 
  chanceToExecute: 0.2
  slowDownNumber: 0.75
